<title>JAPAN: NTN to issue 30 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>NTN to issue 30 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - NTN Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	     ISSUE NO 5    AMT   30 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.85% (tentatively) ISS PRICE     MATURITY 31.Mar.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 6.Jan.97   CONV TO 30.Mar.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 15.Nov.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 8.Nov-14.Nov</p>
<p> LAST JCR   A	   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on November 7.</p>
</text>
